FireANTs command line
Apache-2.0

Registration runs @fireants/fireants, a C/WebAssembly reimplementation of
FireANTs (https://github.com/rohitrango/FireANTs) that is not endorsed by the
FireANTs authors. In a portable archive, its FireANTs License 1.0 is in
licenses/npm/@fireants__fireants/ and its third-party notices are in
app/node_modules/@fireants/fireants/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Please cite: Jena R, Chaudhari P, Gee JC. Adaptive Riemannian optimization for
multi-scale diffeomorphic matching. Nature Communications. 2026;17:4774.
doi:10.1038/s41467-026-72508-3
